  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trout-breeding for the Peasant Families of Sacaba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TUKUYPAJ will expand an experimental program of community-managed trout breeding and farming in 41 high valley Andean lagoons to 10 new communities in the municipalities of Sacaba and Colomi in the Cochabamba department. The project will diversify local food production, increase local trout consumption and related nutritional benefits, especially for children, develop community self-management capacity and increase family income.</narrative>
  </description>
